# CAP04, service B. A skeleton.
#
# Remember whose policy this really is. ESO authenticates as its own
# ServiceAccount and reads on behalf of every ExternalSecret in the cluster, so
# this policy is not "what service B may read": it is "what may be copied into
# Kubernetes Secrets, anywhere".
#
# Write it as the second thing, and keep it as short as that framing implies.

path "# ?" {
  capabilities = [# ?]
}
